---

<div class="flex flex-col gap-4" style="text-wrap: pretty;">
    <h2 class="font-sans text-3xl font-black">APPLYING FOR SPARKHACKS</h2>

    <div class="h-[350px] overflow-y-scroll grid grid-cols-2 justify-around" style="scrollbar-color: gray #ffffff00;">

        <div class="" style="grid-area: 1 / 1 / 1 / 3">
            <p>Information regarding deadlines for applications vary each year. Please keep an eye out on our social media for the latest information about applications!</p>
            <br />
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col p-4" style="border-right: solid black;">
            <h3>Apply as a <span class="font-extrabold">HACKER</span></h3>
            
            <hr />
            <br />

            <ul>
                <li class="mb-4">
                    Applications for participants open during the spring semester to any UIC students regardless of major, year, gender, or prior experience. 
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    First-time hackathon goers and those with little to no expereince are encouraged to apply. 
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    Applications are reviwed anonymously and are not reviewed on a first-come-first-serve basis. 
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    Please apply through the dashboard, as any status updates will be communicated on the dashboard.
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    Please note that while we wish we can accept everyone, due to limitations, there is a limit to how many hackers we are able to let into the event.
                </li>
                <hr />
                <li class="my-4">
                    Visit the dashboard here.
                    <a class="font-extrabold text-blue-500" href="https://dashboard.sparkhacks.org/" target="_blank">https://dashboard.sparkhacks.org/</a>
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col p-4" style="border-left: solid black;">
            <h3>Apply as a <span class="font-extrabold">BOARD MEMBER</span></h3>

            <hr />
            <br />

            <p>
                Applications for the board open up after each SparkHacks event.
            </p>

            <p>
                There are seven different roles within SparkHacks:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li class="my-4">
                    <span class="font-extrabold">Directors</span> --
                    Overseeing and organizing the team, ensuring deadlines, and leading team coordination.
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    <span class="font-extrabold">Communications</span> --
                    Connect and coordinate with sponsors, mentors, judges, and volunteers.
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    <span class="font-extrabold">Experience</span> --
                    Planning tracks, workshops, and the overall event experience to make the hackathon engaging.
                </li class="m-4">
                <li>
                    <span class="font-extrabold">Logistics</span> --
                    Managing funds, securing assets, and tracking inventory.
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    <span class="font-extrabold">Design</span> --
                    Designing the visuals and graphics of posters, banners, swag, website assets, and more.  
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    <span class="font-extrabold">Media</span> --
                    Managing social media, posting content, engaging with followers, and capturing event media.
                </li>
                <li class="my-4">
                    <span class="font-extrabold">Web Development</span> --
                    Developing, maintaining, and improving upon the website, dashboard, and archives.
                </li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>